      "about": {
        "zh": "斑点：每格 base + amp × 一个随机数，种子定下是哪一张",
        "en": "speckles: base + amp × a random number a cell, the seed saying which"
      },
      "params": {
        "type": "obj",
        "fields": {
          "seed": {
            "type": "int"
          },
          "base": {
            "type": "num"
          },
          "amp": {
            "type": "num"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "twoTone": {
      "about": {
        "zh": "两种亮度的颗粒：每格按它在不在形状里（圆 disc、右边 rightOf、斜纹 stripes）随机取亮或暗，各带一点抖动",
